[[Category:Tmp_xyobj(neg)]]

Wildgoat can be tamed to become a [[Goat]]. See [[Taming|this page]] for more info about taming wild animals.
You can feed them a clover. When doing so you gain the ability to leash them with a rope and, if desired, take either 1 wool from them, whose quality will be equal to the clover's.

Spawn in herds, weaker but slightly more agile than a [[Boar]].

==Combat==

===Behaviour===

Wildgoats are extremely aggressive, and will likely engage in combat with nearby players. Aggro all as one.

